<p>US$ 22 billion by 2027 ($35 billion by 2030)</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 123.969px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.7 billion</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 188px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Annual funding for TB research</td>
