</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 394.688px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Initial diagnostic testing&#x000a0;of TB with drug-resistance testing</td>
                <td style="width: 476.312px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>Automated, cartridge-based NAATs
<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>Xpert<sup>&#x000ae;&#x000a0;</sup>MTB/RIF (Xpert<sup>&#x000ae;</sup>)&#x000a0;assay and&#x000a0;Xpert MTB/RIF Ultra (Xpert Ultra<sup>&#x000ae;</sup>)</p></list-item><list-item><p>TrueNat<sup>&#x000ae;&#x000a0;</sup>MTB Plus assay</p></list-item></list>
